 ctives.\nAward: Maximum CHF 25\,000. No application fee.\nDuration: Newly 
 created works presented publicly for the first time\; deadline 1 September
 .\n\nMore: https://prohelvetia.ch/en/find-support/grant-for-production-wit
 h-presentation?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
